  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tPractice Management \n\t\tPractice Management FAQs\n\n### How do deadline reminders work?\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Tue, 28 Apr, 2020 at 12:59 PM\n\n\t\tLocation: Practice Management module > Settings > Services > Select Service > Configure Reminders\n\nYou can add/view the reminders to the tasks.\n\nHelp/Guide:\n\n - You can add/view reminders to the services.\n - There will be a radio button to activate the deadline reminders\n - You may choose the period of how many days/weeks/months before you would like to get the reminder.\n - Here we have two ways to get the reminders. - Through the notifications on the top right-hand side\n - The accountants and the staff members assigned to the service will receive an email reminder.\n\nAlso, you can add multiple reminders for different periods.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115348\">Practice Management </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188583\">Practice Management FAQs</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">How do deadline reminders work?\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Tue, 28 Apr, 2020 at 12:59 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Location:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"> Practice Management module &gt; Settings &gt; Services &gt; Select Service &gt; Configure Reminders<br><br><a href=\"https://appv4.capium.com/#/home/settings-services\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a>You can add/view the reminders to the tasks.<br><br><strong>Help/Guide:</strong><br><br></span></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">You can add/view reminders to the services.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">There will be a radio button to activate the deadline reminders</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">You may choose the period of how many days/weeks/months before you would like to get the reminder.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Here we have two ways to get the reminders.</span><ul><li><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Through the notifications on the top right-hand side</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">The accountants and the staff members assigned to the service will receive an email reminder.</span></li></ul></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Also, you can add multiple reminders for different periods.</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9083450728/original/XEjlmz0tcgOJEOYjQ1jXlpTRNuB9Ovd2sw.png?1565274137\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib fr-fil\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9083450728/original/XEjlmz0tcgOJEOYjQ1jXlpTRNuB9Ovd2sw.png?1565274137\" data-fileid=\"9083450728\" data-uniquekey=\"1565273203933\" style=\"width: 870px;\"></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9101259181/original/OMxpJPfTTb-87_nc4MUAPx8N92ygKGnSDA.png?1588075137\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9101259181\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></p><p><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165783\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000165783/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165783\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000165783/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_down\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"pu